:"IT","title":"Un'aliena al centro della terra","type":""},{"iso_3166_1":"US","title":"Wanda","type":"TV Title"},{"iso_3166_1":"PL","title":"Obcy z Los Angeles","type":""},{"iso_3166_1":"BR","title":"Uma Estranha de Los Angeles","type":"dvd"},{"iso_3166_1":"RU","title":"Пришелец из Лос-Анджелеса","type":"alternative title"},{"iso_3166_1":"GR","title":"Η Εξωγήινη Από το Λος Άντζελες","type":"VHS title"},{"iso_3166_1":"US","title":"Alien from L.A.","type":""},{"iso_3166_1":"DE","title":"Flucht aus Atlantis - Alien from L.A.","type":""}],"externalIds":{"imdb_id":"tt0092532","wikidata_id":"Q2124065","facebook_id":null,"instagram_id":null,"twitter_id":null},"keywords":[{"id":970,"name":"parent child relationship"},{"id":385,"name":"jules verne"},{"id":1963,"name":"expedition"},{"id":3644,"name":"south africa"},{"id":10053,"name":"sexploitation"},{"id":41586,"name":"archaeologist"},{"id":162801,"name":"subterranean"},{"id":179568,"name":"archaeological dig"},{"id":181239,"name":"scientific expedition"},{"id":190025,"name":"secret police"},{"id":194705,"name":"gauteng"},{"id":195394,"name":"hidden civilization"},{"id":195395,"name":"zimbabwe"},{"id":195396,"name":"archaeological expedition"},{"id":195397,"name":"subterranean world"}],"releaseDates":[{"iso_3166_1":"DE","release_dates":[{"certification":"","descriptors":[],"iso_639_1":"","note":"","release_date":"1998-02-07T00:00:00.000Z","type":6}]},{"iso_3166_1":"ES","release_dates":[{"certification":"A","descriptors":[],"iso_639_1":"","note":"","release_date":"1988-02-26T00:00:00.000Z","type":3}]},{"iso_3166_1":"US","release_dates":[{"certification":"PG","descriptors":[],"iso_639_1":"en","note":"","release_date":"1988-02-26T00:00:00.000Z","type":3}]}],"translations":[{"iso_639_1":"en","iso_3166_1":"US","name":"English","english_name":"English","title":"","overview":"When her archaeologist father disappears on an expedition, Wanda sets out to look for him. What she finds is a secret underground world, where no one believes in life on the surface and where she and her father are taken for spies.","tagline":"The people at the center of the earth are about to get a visitor."},{"iso_639_1":"it","iso_3166_1":"IT","name":"Italiano","english_name":"Italian","title":"Un'aliena al centro della Terra","overview":"Wanda Saknussemm alla ricerca di suo padre dato per morto ritrova una stanza segreta che la condurrà nelle profondità della terra. Qui incontra un minatore di nome Gus che l'aiuterà nella ricerca in quella che si scoprirà essere Atlantide.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"ru","iso_3166_1":"RU","name":"Pусский","english_name":"Russian","title":"Инопланетянка из Лос-Анджелеса","overview":"Ванда — скромная простая девушка, ведущая размеренный, даже скучный образ жизни. Ее отец — археолог исчез во время экспедиции, и дочь отправляется на его поиски в Африку. Она оказывается в подземном мире, где никто не верит в существование жизни на поверхности. За исключением секретной полиции, которая считает, что Ванда и ее отец-шпионы. Мужчина считает, что много лет назад на Землю прилетел космический корабль и оказался в глубине её недр, и что под землей может существовать другая цивилизация…","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"es","iso_3166_1":"ES","name":"Español","english_name":"Spanish","title":"Alien from L.A.","overview":"Wanda es una adolescente que lleva una vida aburrida hasta que un día su padre, un conocido arqueólogo, desaparece. En su búsqueda encontrará una extraña y misteriosa civilización subterránea.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"pt","iso_3166_1":"BR","name":"Português","english_name":"Portuguese","title":"Uma Estranha de Los Angeles","overview":"O filme conta a história de Wanda, uma jovem desengonçada, sem mãe, rejeitada pelo pai e abandonada pelo namorado.  Um dia, ela recebe uma carta e uma passagem aérea para visitar um senhor que teria informações importantes sobre seu pai.  No entanto, durante a busca, ela cai em um buraco.  O buraco é um caminho para uma civilização perdida, chamada Atlantis.","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"el","iso_3166_1":"GR","name":"ελληνικά","english_name":"Greek","title":"Η Εξωγήινη Από το Λος Άντζελες","overview":"","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"fr","iso_3166_1":"FR","name":"Français","english_name":"French","title":"L'Aventure fantastique","overview":"Alors que son petit ami vient de la quitter, lui reprochant son manque de goût pour l’aventure, Wanda, une adolescente timide affublée d’énorme lunettes, apprend par une lettre que son père, l’archéologue Arnold Saknussemm, est mort. Wanda quitte Los Angeles pour l’Afrique du Nord, où elle retrouve les notes de son père concernant l’Atlantide…","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"zh","iso_3166_1":"CN","name":"普通话","english_name":"Mandarin","title":"洛城异形","overview":"","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"de","iso_3166_1":"DE","name":"Deutsch","english_name":"German","title":"Flucht aus Atlantis","overview":"Wanda ist ein schüchternes Mädchen mit einem langweiligen Leben. Als ihr Vater, ein Archäologe, eines Tages auf einer Expedition verschwindet, begibt sie sich auf die Suche nach ihm. Dabei gelangt sie in eine unterirdische Welt, in der niemand an eine Welt an der Oberfläche glaubt - außer der Geheimpolizei, die davon ausgeht, dass Wanda und ihr Vater Spione sind...","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"ko","iso_3166_1":"KR","name":"한국어/조선말","english_name":"Korean","title":"LA에서 온 외계인","overview":"","tagline":""},{"iso_639_1":"zh","iso_3166_1":"HK","name":"普通话","english_name":"Mandarin","title":"洛城異形","overview":"","tagline":""}],"videos":[{"key":"DrM1Rz2l6d8","site":"YouTube","type":"Trailer","name":"MST-HD Remaster Vol. 3: An Introduction","iso_639_1":"en","official":false,"published_at":"2024-09-01T19:03:17.000Z","size":1080},{"key":"sLcSP7dzRyo","site":"YouTube","type":"Trailer","name":"Blu-ray Promo Trailer","iso_639_1":"en","official":true,"published_at":"2021-05-28T04:08:38.000Z","size":1080},{"key":"z-SclSgWSa4","site":"YouTube","type":"Trailer","name":"Alien From L.A. (1988) - Trailer (CANNON F